WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.901 --> 00:00:02.334
-Welcome to the show.

00:00:02.334 --> 00:00:03.868
It's your -- it's your
first time on our show.

00:00:03.868 --> 00:00:05.701
-It's my first time,
and I was so happy to be here.

00:00:05.701 --> 00:00:07.434
I'm kind of nervous.
-No!

00:00:07.434 --> 00:00:08.501
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:08.501 --> 00:00:09.834
It's always good
to be a little nervous.

00:00:09.834 --> 00:00:11.634
But we've hung out together.
We've hung out before.

00:00:11.634 --> 00:00:13.033
-We did, at the Met Gala.

00:00:13.033 --> 00:00:14.567
-We were at the Met Gala
together.

00:00:14.567 --> 00:00:15.868
-Yeah.
-We had a good table.

00:00:15.868 --> 00:00:17.667
-Oh, yeah.
We had a lot of fun up there.

00:00:17.667 --> 00:00:19.701
-Yeah, we had some --
we got in some trouble.

00:00:19.701 --> 00:00:21.367
-I know I did.
I could dance my life away.

00:00:21.367 --> 00:00:23.801
-Yeah. Who else was there?
There's Lil Uzi.

00:00:23.801 --> 00:00:25.100
-Lil Uzi.
-Lil Uzi Vert.

00:00:25.100 --> 00:00:26.868
-Erykah Badu.
-Yes!

00:00:26.868 --> 00:00:28.367
Pete Davidson.
-Pete Davidson.

00:00:28.367 --> 00:00:29.868
-Remember,
Pete Davidson got up --

00:00:29.868 --> 00:00:32.567
he got up to meet -- he goes,
"I have to go to the bathroom."

00:00:32.567 --> 00:00:34.033
[ Laughter ]
And we're at this event --

00:00:34.033 --> 00:00:35.734
this Met Gala,
and we're all dressed --

00:00:35.734 --> 00:00:37.100
Thom Browne and I think
we were dressed.

00:00:37.100 --> 00:00:38.367
And they were dressed
really nice.

00:00:38.367 --> 00:00:40.567
And Pete goes, "I have to go
to the men's room."

00:00:40.567 --> 00:00:41.701
I go, "They just announced

00:00:41.701 --> 00:00:42.767
that they're starting
the entertainment.

00:00:42.767 --> 00:00:44.801
Don't go."
-He goes, "I have to."

00:00:44.801 --> 00:00:46.567
[ Laughter ]
And I go, "Really, Pete,

00:00:46.567 --> 00:00:48.667
this is a bad -- bad time.
They just said --"

00:00:48.667 --> 00:00:50.234
He goes,
"Yeah, but they say that.

00:00:50.234 --> 00:00:51.501
I don't think --"
And we were all trying

00:00:51.501 --> 00:00:53.033
to talk him out of it.
-Yeah, for sure.

00:00:53.033 --> 00:00:55.501
-And then he left.
He's like, "I'm gonna do it.

00:00:55.501 --> 00:00:56.968
I'm gonna go to the bathroom."
I go, "Okay, whatever."

00:00:56.968 --> 00:00:58.634
He leaves, and all of a sudden
you hear --

00:00:58.634 --> 00:00:59.767
[ Imitating marching band ]
-[ Laughs ]

00:00:59.767 --> 00:01:01.300
-Just marching band.
-Yep.

00:01:01.300 --> 00:01:02.834
-And this marching band
comes walking in,

00:01:02.834 --> 00:01:04.334
and who's the third person
in the marching band?

00:01:04.334 --> 00:01:05.534
He was like --
-Pete.

00:01:05.534 --> 00:01:07.801
[ Laughter ]
-Pete Davidson.

00:01:07.801 --> 00:01:10.200
I go, "What are you --
I told you, dude." Yeah.

00:01:10.200 --> 00:01:11.567
-But, you know,
sometimes it happens.

00:01:11.567 --> 00:01:12.701
-"Sometimes it happens."
Yeah, yeah, yeah.

00:01:12.701 --> 00:01:14.133
-You get caught up.
-Yeah.

00:01:14.133 --> 00:01:15.534
-He looked good while doing it,
because he's a --

00:01:15.534 --> 00:01:16.834
-He looked good.
-He strolled in pretty cool.

00:01:16.834 --> 00:01:18.133
-Yeah, yeah, yeah.
He looked cool, but I was like,

00:01:18.133 --> 00:01:20.234
"Dude, you clearly do not belong
in the marching band."

00:01:20.234 --> 00:01:21.434
[ Laughter ]

00:01:21.434 --> 00:01:22.834
I like those events
'cause you meet people.

00:01:22.834 --> 00:01:25.000
You go, "Oh, that's the person
I always wanted to meet,"

00:01:25.000 --> 00:01:26.300
and then you just run into them.

00:01:26.300 --> 00:01:27.901
Do you ever get freaked out
when you meet someone?

00:01:27.901 --> 00:01:29.534
-Well, I do.
And it was kind of crazy.

00:01:29.534 --> 00:01:31.334
When I saw you there,
I kind of was like, "Oh, my God.

00:01:31.334 --> 00:01:32.667
I can't believe
I'm sitting next to you."

00:01:32.667 --> 00:01:34.634
-No, stop!
-Honestly.

00:01:34.634 --> 00:01:35.868
-No, no.
-I was like, "Oh, my God.

00:01:35.868 --> 00:01:36.767
This is insane."

00:01:36.767 --> 00:01:38.501
So, yeah,
I do have those moments.

00:01:38.501 --> 00:01:40.434
It's -- it's kind of dope.
-But people come up to you,

00:01:40.434 --> 00:01:41.868
and they freak out
when they see you.

00:01:41.868 --> 00:01:45.167
-I had this crazy moment,
actually, with Khloe Kardashian.

00:01:45.167 --> 00:01:46.601
She came up to me
at the Met Gala,

00:01:46.601 --> 00:01:48.801
and I did not expect that,
and I got freaked out.

00:01:48.801 --> 00:01:50.267
I was like, "Oh, my God."
She said to me,

00:01:50.267 --> 00:01:52.501
"Oh, you're such a presence,
and you're living your life."

00:01:52.501 --> 00:01:54.868
And I was like,
"Wait. You think that of me?"

00:01:54.868 --> 00:01:56.300
[ Laughter ]
"What about you?!"

00:01:56.300 --> 00:01:58.200
-Yeah, you are a presence.
Can I just run down

00:01:58.200 --> 00:01:59.868
some of your recent
accomplishments, please?

00:01:59.868 --> 00:02:02.300
-Okay.
-Emmy nomination for "Pose."

00:02:02.300 --> 00:02:03.834
That's not too shabby
right there...

00:02:03.834 --> 00:02:06.000
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:06.000 --> 00:02:07.367
...to get an Emmy nomination.

00:02:07.367 --> 00:02:09.367
Golden Globe win for "Pose."
-Yes.

00:02:09.367 --> 00:02:12.033
-That was off the chain.
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:12.033 --> 00:02:14.200
One of "Time's"
Women of the Year.

00:02:14.200 --> 00:02:16.901
Oh, yeah.
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:16.901 --> 00:02:17.968
And the winner of GLAAD's

00:02:17.968 --> 00:02:20.334
prestigious
Stephen F. Kolzak Award.

00:02:20.334 --> 00:02:22.634
That is major right there.
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:22.634 --> 00:02:24.334
-Thank you.
-That's 2022 right there.

00:02:24.334 --> 00:02:26.200
Out of these right here,
do you have a favorite

00:02:26.200 --> 00:02:29.400
out of these, or they're all
different in its own way?

00:02:29.400 --> 00:02:32.100
-I would say the Golden Globes
was my favorite

00:02:32.100 --> 00:02:34.634
'cause it's such a prestigious
kind of award,

00:02:34.634 --> 00:02:36.100
and I never thought
I would get it.

00:02:36.100 --> 00:02:37.701
You know, being the kind of
girl that I am,

00:02:37.701 --> 00:02:39.334
you never think that you would
get an award like this.

00:02:39.334 --> 00:02:41.534
So, I was insecure, and I didn't
think that I would, like,

00:02:41.534 --> 00:02:43.968
you know, be deserving
of an award like that.

00:02:43.968 --> 00:02:45.200
And then, when it happened,
I was just like,

00:02:45.200 --> 00:02:46.868
"What is going on
with my life right now?"

00:02:46.868 --> 00:02:48.067
[ Laughter ]

00:02:48.067 --> 00:02:49.667
-But you actually said
that you didn't think

00:02:49.667 --> 00:02:51.000
you would work again
after "Pose."

00:02:51.000 --> 00:02:53.901
-I did. I did.
I know that's crazy, but I did.

00:02:53.901 --> 00:02:56.601
-Why?
-Insecurities.

00:02:56.601 --> 00:02:57.701
-Yeah.
-You know.

00:02:57.701 --> 00:02:59.400
-Gets in your head.
-Yeah.

00:02:59.400 --> 00:03:02.000
Every woman, every trans woman
in the world, they think that,

00:03:02.000 --> 00:03:03.734
you know, they're not gonna be
allotted certain things,

00:03:03.734 --> 00:03:06.067
being who they are.
And then it happens,

00:03:06.067 --> 00:03:07.901
and you're like,
"Oh, this is a pinch-me moment.

00:03:07.901 --> 00:03:09.200
Snap."
You know?

00:03:09.200 --> 00:03:10.234
-Yeah.
-"Oh, snap."

00:03:10.234 --> 00:03:11.834
Yeah, I don't know where
"Snap" came from.

00:03:11.834 --> 00:03:13.033
-"Oh, snap."
It's fine.

00:03:13.033 --> 00:03:15.234
You -- You give a lot of credit
to your mom.

00:03:15.234 --> 00:03:17.767
-I do, I do.
-And, yeah.

00:03:17.767 --> 00:03:20.968
What does she do to support you
when you were coming up?

00:03:20.968 --> 00:03:23.200
-I mean,
my mom just loved on me hard.

00:03:23.200 --> 00:03:26.267
My mom is a strong Black woman,
and she showed exactly

00:03:26.267 --> 00:03:28.300
what a strong Black woman does,
which is love.

00:03:28.300 --> 00:03:30.701
And she cloaked
and protected me safely.

00:03:30.701 --> 00:03:32.934
And I just love that she did
that throughout all of my life.

00:03:32.934 --> 00:03:34.067
You know?
-Yeah.

00:03:34.067 --> 00:03:35.968
Did she know
you were gonna be an actor?

00:03:35.968 --> 00:03:38.434
-Yeah, I was really dramatic
when I was a child.

00:03:38.434 --> 00:03:39.567
[ Laughter ]
So, you know,

00:03:39.567 --> 00:03:40.901
she kind of knew that.

00:03:40.901 --> 00:03:44.000
She had, you know,
speculations of it and stuff.

00:03:44.000 --> 00:03:45.234
She knew.
She definitely knew.

00:03:45.234 --> 00:03:47.801
-She knew, yeah.
And is drama more your thing?

00:03:47.801 --> 00:03:49.567
'Cause in "Loot," on --

00:03:49.567 --> 00:03:52.234
Maya Rudolph, on Apple TV,
you're very funny.

00:03:52.234 --> 00:03:53.801
-Oh, you think so?
Thank you.

00:03:53.801 --> 00:03:55.167
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:03:55.167 --> 00:03:56.801
-Yeah, I do think so.
Yeah, yeah, yeah.

00:03:56.801 --> 00:03:58.467
But you --
which one do you like better?

00:03:58.467 --> 00:03:59.734
-I love drama.

00:03:59.734 --> 00:04:01.834
I love, you know,
crying on the screen.

00:04:01.834 --> 00:04:03.167
I like, you know --
-Crying?

00:04:03.167 --> 00:04:04.367
-I do.
-Really?

00:04:04.367 --> 00:04:05.834
-I do.
It makes me feel good.

00:04:05.834 --> 00:04:08.601
I'm sorry, y'all.
That's weird, but it does.

00:04:08.601 --> 00:04:12.100
-"Loot," Maya Rudolph --
how did you guys meet?

00:04:12.100 --> 00:04:14.467
Did you -- have you known each
other or just from the show?

00:04:14.467 --> 00:04:17.200
-You know, it's so funny.
I met her three years ago,

00:04:17.200 --> 00:04:19.667
I think,
while "Pose" was happening.

00:04:19.667 --> 00:04:21.467
It was at an event.
I can't remember specifically,

00:04:21.467 --> 00:04:24.067
but I remember fanning out
over her and saying,

00:04:24.067 --> 00:04:25.734
"I hope I get
to work with you one day."

00:04:25.734 --> 00:04:28.534
And she said, "You will."
And I was like, "Okay."

00:04:28.534 --> 00:04:30.567
And then boom, it happened.
-It actually happened.

00:04:30.567 --> 00:04:32.734
-Yeah.
-Can you set it up for everyone,

00:04:32.734 --> 00:04:34.167
what the show is about?
-Yes.

00:04:34.167 --> 00:04:38.133
So, this show, "Loot,"
is about a woman

00:04:38.133 --> 00:04:41.334
who goes through tumultuous
times with her marriage

00:04:41.334 --> 00:04:44.000
and inherits all of this money
from this rich man --

00:04:44.000 --> 00:04:45.634
$87 billion.

00:04:45.634 --> 00:04:47.968
And with all
the privileges she has,

00:04:47.968 --> 00:04:49.434
there's some things
that she doesn't know about,

00:04:49.434 --> 00:04:50.634
so she comes back
to her foundation,

00:04:50.634 --> 00:04:52.767
and she meets a woman
named Sofia.

00:04:52.767 --> 00:04:56.400
And they're like oil and water,
but I think, at the end,

00:04:56.400 --> 00:04:58.000
they come together
so beautifully.

00:04:58.000 --> 00:05:00.267
-Yeah, and -- and, yeah,
you help her grow.

00:05:00.267 --> 00:05:02.367
But Maya
plays a ridiculous character.

00:05:02.367 --> 00:05:04.300
-She is hilarious in the show.
-She's unbelievable.

00:05:04.300 --> 00:05:07.334
-Yeah, tell 'em.
-And any rumors of season two?

00:05:07.334 --> 00:05:09.000
I'm just hoping.
-I think we are

00:05:09.000 --> 00:05:10.868
gonna get a season two.
I don't know.

00:05:10.868 --> 00:05:13.234
But I do believe we will.
-Yeah! See?

00:05:13.234 --> 00:05:15.467
That's the way I do it.
I like it right there.

00:05:15.467 --> 00:05:17.167
All right, good.
I want to see it.

00:05:17.167 --> 00:05:19.801
'Cause already, I got to see
like four episodes,

00:05:19.801 --> 00:05:21.100
and I'm like, "Oh, yeah.
I'm sold."

00:05:21.100 --> 00:05:23.167
-Oh, you did? Okay.
-Yeah, Maya snuck them to me.

00:05:23.167 --> 00:05:24.434
-Oh, okay.
-I want to show a clip.

00:05:24.434 --> 00:05:26.734
Here is Michaela Jae Rodriguez
in "Loot."

00:05:26.734 --> 00:05:28.167
Take a look at this.

00:05:28.167 --> 00:05:30.701
-We can't just fly to Miami
on a random Tuesday,

00:05:30.701 --> 00:05:31.934
especially when we have
a meeting

00:05:31.934 --> 00:05:33.467
with Councilmember Saldana
today.

00:05:33.467 --> 00:05:35.567
-Oh, I had Nicholas call her.
We're moving it to a Zoom.

00:05:35.567 --> 00:05:38.567
-A Zoo--
I hate Zooms.

00:05:38.567 --> 00:05:40.067
I don't get to show off
my personality.

00:05:40.067 --> 00:05:42.634
How the hell are they gonna see
my sweet side?

00:05:42.634 --> 00:05:45.501
-Sofia, look at everybody.

00:05:45.501 --> 00:05:47.434
They're so excited.

00:05:47.434 --> 00:05:49.834
Look, they're taking pictures
of my plane.

00:05:49.834 --> 00:05:51.667
Don't take this away from them.

00:05:51.667 --> 00:05:54.901
It's all gonna work out.
Come on.

00:05:54.901 --> 00:05:56.400
Come on.

00:05:56.400 --> 00:05:57.767
-Fine.

00:05:57.767 --> 00:05:59.267
♪♪

00:05:59.267 --> 00:06:00.367
-She's coming.

00:06:00.367 --> 00:06:03.934
You guys, she's coming!

00:06:03.934 --> 00:06:05.000
-"They're taking pictures
of my plane."

00:06:05.000 --> 00:06:06.067
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:06:06.067 --> 00:06:09.133
Michaela Jae Rodriguez,
everybody!

00:06:09.133 --> 00:06:12.000
New episodes of "Loot"
are available every Friday

00:06:12.000 --> 00:06:13.467
on Apple TV+.

